{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>בארח</b> — the meaning is: on account of the path of righteousness the righteous one attains life, namely the life of his soul, or he lives many days." "<b>ודרך נתיבה</b> — of righteousness, to death, meaning that there be death of the soul like death of the body, or he does not die like the death of the wicked."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:28.612330106Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}